      "AI analyzes large amounts of data and provides insights to support smarter business decisions.\n",
      "Improved healthcare\n",
      "AI helps in disease detection, medical image analysis, drug discovery, and personalized treatment.\n",
      "Faster software development\n",
      "AI coding assistants help developers write code, find bugs, generate tests, and understand complex systems.\n",
      "Personalized learning\n",
      "AI enables customized education by adapting lessons based on individual learning speed and needs.\n",
      "Enhanced customer experience\n",
      "AI chatbots and virtual assistants provide 24/7 support and faster responses.\n",
      "Innovation and new opportunities\n",
